{"id":"660586","name":"吐司三明治","author":"莱拉小厨房","authorId":"10296546","desc":"","cover":"images/660586/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"吐司","amount":"3块"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"火腿","amount":"1片"},{"name":"肉松","amount":"适量"},{"name":"西红柿","amount":"1片"},{"name":"黄瓜","amount":"半个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"煎烤机刷油，打入鸡蛋，盖盖煎5分钟。","img":"images/660586/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将黄瓜、西红柿切片。","img":"images/660586/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"吐司依次排开，下铺保鲜膜（铺大一点）。","img":"images/660586/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"挤上沙拉酱。","img":"images/660586/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"依次放上食材。","img":"images/660586/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"挤上番茄沙司。","img":"images/660586/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"吐司重合，包上保鲜膜。","img":"images/660586/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"从中间切开就OK啦。","img":"images/660586/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}